---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="CV & Opportunities — Xuanming Zhang"
  description="Xuanming Zhang is open to exceptional frontier-AI industry opportunities and top PhD programs across CS, AI, cognitive science, and psychology. CV available by request."
  active="connect"
>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="page-hero connect-hero">
      <p class="index-label">Selective conversations / 2026–27</p>
      <h1>The CV is private.<br />The conversation is open.</h1>
      <p>I am open to exceptional opportunities where frontier AI, cognitive systems, and consequential interaction can be pursued with unusual depth and ambition.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="connect-body" aria-labelledby="connect-title">
      <header>
        <p class="index-label">What I am considering</p>
        <h2 id="connect-title">High-agency environments<br />for foundational work.</h2>
      </header>
      <div class="connect-paths">
        <article>
          <span>01 / Industry</span>
          <h3>Frontier AI labs and research leadership</h3>
          <p>Research scientist, post-training or interactive-intelligence leadership, and founding technical roles with the mandate to turn original research into field-shaping systems.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span>02 / Doctoral study</span>
          <h3>Top PhD programs across four interfaces</h3>
          <p>Computer science, artificial intelligence, cognitive science, and psychology — especially programs connecting foundation models with human cognition, interaction, and long-horizon behavior.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
      <aside class="connect-invite">
        <p>If the fit is serious, send a concise note about the research problem, team, and expected role. I will share the current CV directly when useful.</p>
        <div class="connect-actions">
          <a class="action action-dark" data-analytics="cv_request" href="mailto:xuanmingdi.zxm@alibaba-inc.com?subject=Research%20opportunity%20%2F%20CV%20request&body=Hello%20Xuanming%2C%0A%0AContext%20%2F%20organization%3A%0AResearch%20problem%20or%20role%3A%0AWhy%20the%20fit%20may%20be%20strong%3A%0ATimeline%3A%0A%0A">Request the current CV →</a>
          <a class="action connect-dm" data-analytics="contact_intent" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/xuanming-zhang-54b9b5290">DM on LinkedIn ↗</a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>
    <SiteFooter />
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
